  "llm_summary": "This database schema is designed for an e-commerce and retail management system that tracks various aspects of business operations including sales orders, customers, products, credit cards, territories, and more. The core entities include customers who place orders through a shopping cart or directly as sales orders, with each order detailing items purchased and any discounts applied via special offers. Salespeople are associated with specific territories and manage their quotas and performance metrics. Currency rates help in handling international transactions by converting between different currencies. Additionally, the schema includes tables for managing tax rates applicable to different states and tracking historical changes in territory assignments and salesperson quotas over time."
